[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/30.tres]邓义（邓羲）[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]基本信息：[/color] 生卒年不可考；籍贯章陵（今河南[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "南阳", "cat": "geography"}]南阳[/url][/color]西南）；东汉末荆州名士，任[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘表", "cat": "people"}]刘表[/url][/color]治中从事，降曹后任侍中


